# Credits and History

This project is a maintained fork of the original DokuWiki Vector template.
The maintained fork keeps the original GPLv2 license and preserves the original
authors' notices.

## Acknowledgements

ARSAVA <dokuwiki@dev.arsava.com> created and maintained the original DokuWiki
Vector template.

- Website: <https://dev.arsava.com/>

viasnake <https://github.com/viasnake/> maintains this fork and modernizes the
template for current DokuWiki releases while preserving the legacy Vector 2010
look.

- Project: <https://github.com/viasnake/dokuwiki-template-vector>

