## Third-Party Sources

The original template import used files and ideas from these upstream projects:

- MediaWiki Vector skin: <https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Skin:Vector>
- DokuWiki default template.
- DokuWiki starter template.
- Monobook for DokuWiki, used as the original base for non-layout template
  behavior and configuration patterns.

Third-party static files are kept under `static/3rd/`. See inline notes in that
directory for source-specific details.

## Original Creation Notes

These notes document the original template import and are kept for historical
context.

- Downloaded the MediaWiki Vector skin source from
  <https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Skin:Vector>.
- Installed DokuWiki locally for testing.
- Copied all Monobook for DokuWiki sources because it already fit some needs
  regarding configuration options and non-layout features. The Monobook for
  DokuWiki template was used as the base for Vector for DokuWiki.
- Replaced `monobook` with `vector` in `conf/`, `lang/`, `detail.php`,
  `inc_cite.php`, `inc_detail.php`, `main.php`, and `mediamanager.php`.
- Copied selected third-party files into `static/3rd/`:
  - From MediaWiki Vector: `skins/vector/main-ltr.css`,
    `skins/vector/main-rtl.css`, and `skins/vector/images/*`.
  - From Andreas Gohr's DokuWiki default template: `default/*.css`,
    `default/images/closed.gif`, `default/images/favicon.ico`,
    `default/images/open.gif`, and `default/images/tocdot2.gif`.
  - From Anika Henke's DokuWiki starter template:
    `starter/images/external-link.png`, `starter/images/unc.png`, and
    `starter/images/email.png`.
- Adjusted image URLs in `static/3rd/vector/main-ltr.css` and
  `static/3rd/vector/main-rtl.css` for the DokuWiki template layout. The LTR
  file is loaded through DokuWiki's CSS dispatcher; the RTL file is loaded
  directly only for right-to-left languages, so its URLs remain relative to its
  own directory.
- Adjusted image URLs in `static/3rd/dokuwiki/*.css` for this template and
  documented the change in file comments.
- Visited <https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=ASCII>, copied the HTML
  source, and used Tidy to get valid, clean, correctly indented base markup
  after core removal. That markup was compared with `main.php` and the needed
  changes were made.
- Created `vector/static/css/print.css`, `vector/static/css/rtl.css`, and
  `vector/static/css/screen.css`.
- Completed the initial port.
- After about one year, switched the CSS base from DokuWiki's default template
  to <https://www.dokuwiki.org/template:starter>. See
  `static/3rd/dokuwiki/00_starter-tmpl-notes.txt` for details.
